	(text "DSP board (ADAU1466 + XU316) for NeatAmp V1.3 - connectors + main parts placed (2026-11-27).\nStacked on the main board on 4 x M3 standoffs (15-20 mm) at MH1-MH4; same XY coordinates as NeatAmp.kicad_pcb.\nPower: own regulators from +5V_IN (review P2-10): AP63203 3.3 V, 2x AP63201 1.2 V / 0.9 V, LDO 1.8 V, sequenced via EN;\ninput bulk 47-100 uF + ceramics. I2C pull-ups to this board 3.3 V. Bottom side: no parts (faces the main board)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c9870dc3-8dca-40df-8951-56e46e0679c6")
