	(text "POWER (review A24 / P2-10) - parts placed, not wired yet. All bucks from +5V_IN, EN chain for sequencing\n(3.3 V first, then 1.2 V / 0.9 V); soft-start limits inrush through CN1.\nU1 AP63203 3.3 V | U2 AP63201 1.2 V ADAU1466 DVDD (FB divider) | U3 AP63201 0.9 V XU316 VDD (FB divider)\nStill to add: 1.8 V LDO (XU316 VDDIOB18, OTP, USB_VDD18), inductors 6.8 uH (AP63201) / 3.9 uH (AP63203), caps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
